WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Check people, times, positions, breaks and the selected week.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:17.833
Step 2: Resolve invalid or overlapping shifts and review availability, leave and cost warnings. Open the small red award error icon beside the staff name or on a shift card to read that person’s checks.

3
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:23.833
Step 3: Wait for draft saves to finish, then choose Publish roster.

4
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:30.958
Step 4: When award checks require a review note, review the warning and enter the required note before completing publication.
